  "summary": "AIOHTTP: File descriptor exhaustion in multipart requests",
  "details": "### Summary\n\nAn attacker can exhaust file descriptors with specially crafted multipart requests.\n\n### Impact\n\nIf a handler uses `Request.post()`, it may be possible for an attacker to use an unlimited number of file descriptors, potentially resulting in resource exhaustion.",
